        <mxCell id="mtMabUNgsPTIBse-VZeg-2" parent="1" style="text;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;" value="&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font: 16px / 24px ui-sans-serif, system-ui, sans-serif, &amp;quot;Apple Color Emoji&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI Emoji&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI Symbol&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Noto Color Emoji&amp;quot;; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; line-height: 24px; text-align: left; white-space: normal; display: list-item; flex: 0 1 auto; flex-direction: row; justify-content: normal; align-items: normal; padding: 0px; margin: 0px; background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0) none repeat scroll 0% 0% / auto padding-box border-box; background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;&lt;code style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font: 16px / 24px ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Menlo, Monaco, Consolas, &amp;quot;Liberation Mono&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Courier New&amp;quot;, monospace; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; line-height: 24px; text-align: left; white-space: normal; display: inline; flex: 0 1 auto; flex-direction: row; justify-content: normal; align-items: normal; padding: 0px; margin: 0px; background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0) none repeat scroll 0% 0% / auto padding-box border-box; background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;HAL 库&lt;/code&gt; 默认用 &lt;code style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font: 16px / 24px ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Menlo, Monaco, Consolas, &amp;quot;Liberation Mono&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Courier New&amp;quot;, monospace; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; line-height: 24px; text-align: left; white-space: normal; display: inline; flex: 0 1 auto; flex-direction: row; justify-content: normal; align-items: normal; padding: 0px; margin: 0px; background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0) none repeat scroll 0% 0% / auto padding-box border-box; background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;SysTick&lt;/code&gt; 定时器，给 &lt;code style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font: 16px / 24px ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Menlo, Monaco, Consolas, &amp;quot;Liberation Mono&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Courier New&amp;quot;, monospace; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; line-height: 24px; text-align: left; white-space: normal; display: inline; flex: 0 1 auto; flex-direction: row; justify-content: normal; align-items: normal; padding: 0px; margin: 0px; background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0) none repeat scroll 0% 0% / auto padding-box border-box; background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;HAL_Delay()&lt;/code&gt;、&lt;code style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font: 16px / 24px ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Menlo, Monaco, Consolas, &amp;quot;Liberation Mono&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Courier New&amp;quot;, monospace; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; line-height: 24px; text-align: left; white-space: normal; display: inline; flex: 0 1 auto; flex-direction: row; justify-content: normal; align-items: normal; padding: 0px; margin: 0px; background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0) none repeat scroll 0% 0% / auto padding-box border-box; background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;HAL_GetTick()&lt;/code&gt; 这些函数提供时间基准；&lt;/li&gt;&#xa;&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font: 16px / 24px ui-sans-serif, system-ui, sans-serif, &amp;quot;Apple Color Emoji&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI Emoji&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI Symbol&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Noto Color Emoji&amp;quot;; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; line-height: 24px; text-align: left; white-space: normal; display: list-item; flex: 0 1 auto; flex-direction: row; justify-content: normal; align-items: normal; padding: 0px; margin: 0px; background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0) none repeat scroll 0% 0% / auto padding-box border-box; background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;&lt;code style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font: 16px / 24px ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Menlo, Monaco, Consolas, &amp;quot;Liberation Mono&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Courier New&amp;quot;, monospace; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; line-height: 24px; text-align: left; white-space: normal; display: inline; flex: 0 1 auto; flex-direction: row; justify-content: normal; align-items: normal; padding: 0px; margin: 0px; background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0) none repeat scroll 0% 0% / auto padding-box border-box; background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;FreeRTOS&lt;/code&gt; 也默认用 &lt;code style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font: 16px / 24px ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Menlo, Monaco, Consolas, &amp;quot;Liberation Mono&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Courier New&amp;quot;, monospace; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; line-height: 24px; text-align: left; white-space: normal; display: inline; flex: 0 1 auto; flex-direction: row; justify-content: normal; align-items: normal; padding: 0px; margin: 0px; background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0) none repeat scroll 0% 0% / auto padding-box border-box; background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;SysTick&lt;/code&gt; 做任务调度的 “心跳”（比如 1ms 一次滴答）；&lt;/li&gt;&#xa;&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font: 16px / 24px ui-sans-serif, system-ui, sans-serif, &amp;quot;Apple Color Emoji&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI Emoji&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI Symbol&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Noto Color Emoji&amp;quot;; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; line-height: 24px; text-align: left; white-space: normal; display: list-item; flex: 0 1 auto; flex-direction: row; justify-content: normal; align-items: normal; padding: 0px; margin: 0px; background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0) none repeat scroll 0% 0% / auto padding-box border-box; background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;两个东西抢同一个定时器，会导致：&lt;ol style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font: 16px / 24px ui-sans-serif, system-ui, sans-serif, &amp;quot;Apple Color Emoji&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI Emoji&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI Symbol&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Noto Color Emoji&amp;quot;; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; line-height: 24px; text-align: left; white-space: normal; display: block; flex: 0 1 auto; flex-direction: row; justify-content: normal; align-items: normal; padding: 0px; margin: 0px; background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0) none repeat scroll 0% 0% / auto padding-box border-box; background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;&#xa;&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font: 16px / 24px ui-sans-serif, system-ui, sans-serif, &amp;quot;Apple Color Emoji&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI Emoji&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI Symbol&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Noto Color Emoji&amp;quot;; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; line-height: 24px; text-align: left; white-space: normal; display: list-item; flex: 0 1 auto; flex-direction: row; justify-content: normal; align-items: normal; padding: 0px; margin: 0px; background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0) none repeat scroll 0% 0% / auto padding-box border-box; background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;&lt;code style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font: 16px / 24px ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Menlo, Monaco, Consolas, &amp;quot;Liberation Mono&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Courier New&amp;quot;, monospace; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; line-height: 24px; text-align: left; white-space: normal; display: inline; flex: 0 1 auto; flex-direction: row; justify-content: normal; align-items: normal; padding: 0px; margin: 0px; background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0) none repeat scroll 0% 0% / auto padding-box border-box; background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;HAL_Delay()&lt;/code&gt; 延时不准，甚至卡死；&lt;/li&gt;&#xa;&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font: 16px / 24px ui-sans-serif, system-ui, sans-serif, &amp;quot;Apple Color Emoji&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI Emoji&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI Symbol&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Noto Color Emoji&amp;quot;; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; line-height: 24px; text-align: left; white-space: normal; display: list-item; flex: 0 1 auto; flex-direction: row; justify-content: normal; align-items: normal; padding: 0px; margin: 0px; background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0) none repeat scroll 0% 0% / auto padding-box border-box; background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;FreeRTOS 任务调度异常，程序跑飞。&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ol&gt;&lt;/li&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="270" width="600" x="1180" y="150" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
